# Firebase config is an EAS file secret. The on-disk path differs locally
# (e.g. Downloads/…) vs on EAS (eas-environment-secrets/…); hashing either
# side alone flips the fingerprint runtimeVersion and fails Configure expo-updates.
# Push config is not native-module surface — omit it from the runtime hash.
**/eas-environment-secrets/**
.eas/.env/**
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
